01:03:43,257 --> 01:03:52,657
Hololive English Advent 2nd Anniversary Celebration!

579
01:03:53,257 --> 01:04:14,657
[Text: Frame Art Board Illustration Size: Approx. H155 x W277mm Using a thick paper frame!] First up, we have the framed art board. It's a large illustration board framed beautifully. The luxurious frame features our logo with foil stamping for extra shine. It's a perfect item to decorate your home and to enjoy looking at every single day so you can see all of us together, just like we should be.

580
01:04:18,657 --> 01:04:52,657
[Text: Sticker Set (Halloween 2024 ver.) (5 Types) Shiori Novella Koseki Bijou Nerissa Ravencroft Fuwawa Abyssgard Mococo Abyssgard] Well, next up, we have a sticker set from 2024 Halloween version! Five different designs, and it includes a VIP art chat design released for Halloween, plus a three-piece sticker set featuring each Advent member's original design. And then you can put them on your phone, stick them on your PC, and have fun with them! All right, next up, we got the connecting charm!

581
01:04:52,957 --> 01:05:00,157
[Text: Connecting Charm (6 Types) Shiori Novella Koseki Bijou Nerissa Ravencroft Fuwawa Abyssgard Mococo Abyssgard Hang it on the zip of your jacket!] What's awesome is that all these charms can actually connect!

582
01:05:00,590 --> 01:05:08,750
To each other... you can mix and match! Find all kinds of different ways, right? Have fun!

583
01:05:09,290 --> 01:05:19,630
Finally, we've got the varsity jacket! It's got the Advent logo on the back, and Pooky is embroidered on the front test area too!

584
01:05:20,130 --> 01:05:29,090
And guess what! You can actually attach those charms I just showed you on the zipper of the jacket too!

585
01:05:29,590 --> 01:05:35,110
You know, it's a cool item that you can rock both in your everyday life and in events too!

586
01:05:35,490 --> 01:05:43,890
And guess what! It's happening right now! The merch just dropped at the hololive official shop!

587
01:05:44,450 --> 01:05:57,830
Hey guys, notice that guy showing up on the bottom of the bottom left, left of the YouTube screen? Go ahead and make it to shop your favorites, okay?

588
01:05:58,730 --> 01:06:15,710
This was such a wonderful day together. We had so much fun! Even though we were running from Justice at the time... Yeah, but that's a typical Friday. Were we really worried? No. Better luck next time, Justice! As if you could ever catch us!

